--- !u!114 &519221857468162647
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1655102036094127300}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 18
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: "Supongo que sabr\xE1s que tienes mucha responsabilidad entre manos,
    y que tus palabras pueden cambiar el destino de la vida de las personas con las
    que trates."
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &2487161388876897246
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1655102036094127300}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 19
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: "Es por eso que te hemos dejado encima de la mesa un manual, con instrucciones
    para lidiar con los diferentes perfiles que se puedan poner en contacto contigo.
    Te recomiendo que, aunque no est\xE9s atendiendo a nadie, le eches un vistazo
    para ir familiariz\xE1ndote con \xE9l."
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &2966077367034712142
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1655102036094127300}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 20
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: "Tambi\xE9n tienes a tu disposici\xF3n un ordenador, en el que podr\xE1s
    tomar datos y notas sobre tus pacientes."
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &9045778287088314088
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1655102036094127300}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 21
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: "Te recomiendo que apuntes toda informaci\xF3n que consideres importante,
    ya que tratar\xE1s con muchas personas y puede ser dif\xEDcil retener tanta informaci\xF3n."
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &821414606429019513
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1655102036094127300}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 22
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: "Te veo abrumado con tanta informaci\xF3n. Para ense\xF1arte c\xF3mo
    trabajamos, y tambi\xE9n ponerte a prueba, quiero que dialogues conmigo imaginando
    que soy un paciente an\xF3nimo. "
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &3477712169665347660
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1655102036094127300}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 23
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: "Est\xE1 bien."
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &6785274348768219832
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1655102036094127300}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 24
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: "Antes de comenzar con el simulacro, te dir\xE9 las pautas comunes a
    seguir."
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &6307723171826947283
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1655102036094127300}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 25
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: "Lo primero es identificar el perfil con el que se est\xE1 tratando.
    El manual detalla los posibles perfiles y las distintas se\xF1ales que definen
    a cada individuo. "
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &1802371888224120228
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1655102036094127300}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 26
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: "Adem\xE1s, es importante que seas consciente de que las personas son
    seres complejos y no tienen por qu\xE9 adherirse a un solo diagn\xF3stico."
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &5578693598025829751
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1655102036094127300}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 27
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: "Ten cuidado, hay que tener en cuenta que cada persona es un mundo y
    todo lo que est\xE9 escrito en el manual puede no ser igual de \xFAtil para todas."
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &3345621760939086752
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1655102036094127300}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 28
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: "Y lo m\xE1s importante, intenta que la conversaci\xF3n se sienta humana
    y cercana en todo momento. Es un puesto de mucha responsabilidad y, aunque sea
    un trabajo, est\xE1s lidiando con personas en situaciones muy fr\xE1giles."
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &1472557227685449200
